    "body": "## Summary\n\nFinal commit of ADR-045. Marks the ADR as Implemented with a **scroll-verified delta** — the first ADR this session to use scroll-position PNG verification rather than first-viewport PNG.\n\n## The delta\n\n**Scroll-PNG verified at External Links section** (~6-8 scroll heights down, past History + Markup). Boxed-arrow icons (16×14px) appear next to external URLs:\n\n- \"Tim Berners-Lee Gives the Web a New Definition [icon]\"\n- \"List of all HTML elements from all major versions [icon]\"\n- \"HTML Entities [icon]\"\n- \"Sean B. Palmer... [icon]\"\n- \"https://www.w3.org/MarkUp/HTMLPlus/htmlplus_1.html [icon]\"\n\n**Zero first-viewport delta** (expected — lead has no external links).\n\n**No false positives** — internal `/wiki/` links (\"CERN\", \"W3C\", \"WHATWG\") appear without icons. Correct behavior.\n\n## Honest scoping note\n\nMeasurement reported \"**242** `.external` elements in article HTML\". That count included:\n- Wrapper elements (compound classes)\n- Mobile-only content\n- Duplicate class matches\n\n**Actual visible icon delta: ~15-25 icons**, concentrated in External Links section plus a few inline in body prose.\n\n**The delta is real and unambiguous when reached.** The 242 raw count was a **count** measurement, not a **visible** measurement — same count-vs-visible distinction ADR-044's \"4+ predicted vs subtle at 2px\" already established.\n\n## Verification categories — now four, not three\n\nADR-045 introduces a fourth verification category to the session's honest ledger:\n\n| Category | Example | PNG check |\n|---|---|---|\n| **PNG-verified at first viewport** | ADR-042 title underline, ADR-043 toolbar line | ✅ First-viewport PNG |\n| **PNG-verified at scroll** | **ADR-045 external link icons** | ✅ Scroll-position PNG |\n| **Behaviorally-complete, visually-subtle** | ADR-044 rounded corners | ⚠️ Not screenshot-verifiable |\n| **Deferred with reason** | ADR-041 literal pseudo text | N/A |\n\nEach category is legitimate, each is honestly labeled, none pretends to be a different category than it is.\n\n## Docs updated\n\n- ADR-045 → Implemented with full Implementation section\n- ADR-034: Post-ADR-045 note (inline extension, `mask-image` deferral)\n- README row 045\n- CHANGELOG entry\n\n## Test count\n\n- 572 cases / 2224 assertions all pass\n- Documentation only; no code changes\n\nRefs #218\n",
